author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:47:54 -0600
subject: fix(deno-deploy): log cleanup DELETE failures instead of silent swallow (GAP-P3-09)

Two .catch(() => {}) blocks silently swallowed Deno app cleanup failures:
- Line 119: cleanup after deploy error
- Line 150: cleanup after failed status check

Both now log via console.error with contextual tag so ops can see when
orphaned Deno apps fail to delete. Mirrors GAP-P2-02 pattern in chat.js.

Adds vitest unit tests covering both paths (mock fetch chain rejects on
cleanup DELETE, asserts console.error fires with the right tag).

